<p>You gain a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">27%, 42%, 52%, 58%, 64%</acronym> resistance to diseases, and each of your melee attacks have a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">8%, 13%, 16%, 19%, 21%</acronym> chance to spread any diseases on your target.</p><p>(As the Epidemic talent with the melee attack treated like blight damage.)</p>